      "side": 1,
      "message": "`SkShader::isOpaque()` would almost work instead, except is always returns false for `kDecal` tiling.  I presume `kDecal` + opaque stops does not run into the same issues, so unfortunately it\u0027s not a perfect substitute, but maybe it could be an early exit (since the gradient shader doesn\u0027t have to scan its stops):\n\n```\n    if (shader-\u003eisOpaque()) {\n        return false;\n    }\n```",
